[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6661.75, "timestamp": "01:51:01", "text": "角の端で"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6664.31, "timestamp": "01:51:04", "text": "壁か何か。うん。彼は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6666.229, "timestamp": "01:51:06", "text": "吠える、吠える、吠える、吠える。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6668.95, "timestamp": "01:51:08", "text": "私は「何が起こったの？」と思いました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6671.669, "timestamp": "01:51:11", "text": "そして私はそれを見る。それはまるで死んでいるかのようだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6674.95, "timestamp": "01:51:14", "text": "ハエかミミズか何か。彼の吠え声"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6677.27, "timestamp": "01:51:17", "text": "掻きむしって取り出そうとしている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6679.43, "timestamp": "01:51:19", "text": "そして、すべて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6693.99, "timestamp": "01:51:33", "text": "まるで誰かが強盗をしているかのように叫ぶ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6696.95, "timestamp": "01:51:36", "text": "家とか、そういうところ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6705.75, "timestamp": "01:51:45", "text": "それはあなたが誓って"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6706.12, "timestamp": "01:51:46", "author": "@mattmeownster", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_k0PVo4Ayjzf9FlRcdjZAQYBwK430_hLvWlP9jgikQjC65W-ONDWjkk4dykteuHJ96HgQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lmao"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6709.27, "timestamp": "01:51:49", "text": "ああ、それはすごいことだった。それで、私は掃除しました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6711.99, "timestamp": "01:51:51", "text": "すべてです。犬をすべて処分する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6715.75, "timestamp": "01:51:55", "text": "髪の毛も何もかも。掃除しました。えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6719.27, "timestamp": "01:51:59", "text": "ホースを使って水を撒いた。清掃済み"}]